LM-Review vote < LLM_REVIEW_MAX","project.config now enforces Verified=MAX as a co-equal gate (submit-requirement 'Verified')"],"finding":"With a second active gate, the plan does not specify how a Verified-blocked outcome (CI red / Verified -1) maps onto the script's three terminal states. Today GATE-BLOCKED (exit 3) is keyed solely on LLM-Review < MAX; a CI-red change is a valid gate outcome (like an LLM -1) but its exit-code semantics are left undefined.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff8d9f2d9544e1579","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan Approach / Acceptance Criteria (two-vote gate) vs reviewbot-e2e.sh terminal-state model (lines 15-26, 211-215)","norm_id":"nb2d8d57297527347","priority":0.5956,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Verified is -1 (CI failed) while LLM-Review is +1: the script's current logic would sail past the LLM check and then fail the submit assertion as HARNESS-FAILURE (exit 2) rather than GATE-BLOCKED (exit 3), conflating a valid gate decline with an infra failure"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8889,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Read the Verified vote from the CI/gerrit-to-platform service account (not $BOT_USER) and size the poll timeout for a full CI run (compare the sibling script's 480s) so a legitimately-slow Verified vote is not misreported as HARNESS-FAILURE.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.0333,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["reviewbot-e2e.sh bot_max_vote() filters votes to `bot in name` for LLM-Review only (lines 174-194)","feature-branch-e2e.sh:79 POLL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS default 480 (CI-aware) vs reviewbot-e2e.sh:81 default 240","project.config: Verified is 'cast by gerrit-to-platform's GitHub Actions run via SSH' — a separate account and slower than the LLM review"],"finding":"The plan does not account for the Verified vote being cast by a different (CI/gerrit-to-platform) service account and arriving only after a full GitHub Actions run. The current bot_max_vote reads votes by $BOT_USER on LLM-Review only, and POLL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS defaults to 240s; the sibling live script that waits on CI uses 480s. Reusing the LLM-only poll shape and the 240s timeout for the CI-dependent Verified vote invites spurious HARNESS-FAILUREs.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f1ff8ab05192ae71e","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan-review remediation 2026-09-06, first bullet (Gerrit polling logic parses the current patchset's labels)","norm_id":"n7bdf78f9b3be3125","priority":0.5667,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The GitHub Actions CI run takes longer than 240s to complete and cast Verified; the poll times out and reports HARNESS-FAILURE despite a working pipe","The parser looks for Verified under $BOT_USER and never sees the CI account's vote"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.6667,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"omits_required_site","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"medium"}}},{"block_threshold":0.9,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Verify the exact Gerrit LabelInfo shape for Verified under `o=DETAILED_LABELS` and pin the parse to the observed field (align with the proven `labels.Verified.all[].value` integer read) rather than the unverified `.recommended` summary; record the observed JSON as MATCH/MISMATCH evidence and shape the stub fixtures to it.","cohort":["T3"],"criteria":["T3"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.3789,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Remediation text: 'require `Verified.recommended` (or equivalent `+1`) in addition to `LLM-Review +1`'","feature-branch-e2e.sh account_vote reads labels.<label>.all[].value as an int under /changes/$1/detail?o=DETAILED_LABELS (lines 122-137) — no '.recommended' key is used","reviewbot-e2e.sh bot_max_vote uses the same all[]/value integer pattern (lines 174-194)","EVIDENCE CLASS: Unverified — the '.recommended' field name was not confirmed against a live/fixtured Gerrit response for the o=DETAILED_LABELS query the script uses"],"finding":"The remediation directs the poll loop to require 'Verified.recommended (or equivalent +1)', but the proven sibling harness reads the CI bot's integer labels.Verified.all[].value under o=DETAILED_LABELS; the '.recommended' LabelInfo summary field is part of the DEFAULT (non-detailed) label representation and is typically suppressed when DETAILED_LABELS is requested, so the named field's presence and semantics under the query the script actually issues are unverified.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f94adac8af6134308","impact":0.67,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan-review remediation 2026-09-06, first bullet ('require Verified.recommended (or equivalent +1)')","norm_id":"nf7d756b66803d749","priority":0.5211,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Verified is +1 but the JSON under DETAILED_LABELS omits the 'recommended' summary field, so the parser never sees the vote and the wait loop times out into a false HARNESS-FAILURE","The stubbed 'both labels +1' fixture is authored to match '.recommended' but the real Gerrit shape uses all[].value, so the test passes while the live script fails after ship"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Reuse feature-branch-e2e.sh's account_vote pattern: read labels.Verified.all[].value as an int and require >= VERIFIED_MAX for the CI bot account, and author the stubbed change JSON with the all[]/value structure so the focused test exercises the same code path the live script uses.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impac